{"diagnosis": "Loopback send of 0xa5 returned 0xff idle with TRAP uart data mismatch got 0xff want 0xa5. ser_tx = send_pattern[0] never loaded {1'b1, reg_dat_di[7:0], 1'b0} because send_bitcnt was held at 15 by send_dummy. Root cause is `if (reg_div_we) send_dummy <= 1` retriggering a 15-bit dummy idle after divider write, so `reg_dat_we && !send_bitcnt` is false and the byte is dropped.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -109,7 +109,5 @@
 	always @(posedge clk) begin
-		if (reg_div_we)
-			send_dummy <= 1;
 		send_divcnt <= send_divcnt + 1;
 		if (!resetn) begin
 			send_pattern <= ~1;
 			send_bitcnt <= 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS, loopback got 0xa5 no TRAP uart data mismatch, checksum != 9e1b73c13d0a095f6b9512137fc937a720f9b8a80231ffc4b660d6d1459f6985"}

